00:24:21.383 --> 00:24:23.295
It looks, you definitely got so much better.

833
00:24:23.295 --> 00:24:24.775
Yeah.

834
00:24:24.775 --> 00:24:26.177
Yeah, it's cool.

835
00:24:26.177 --> 00:24:28.609
And some of those videos have millions of views.

836
00:24:28.609 --> 00:24:29.442
