878
00:25:44.720 --> 00:25:47.431
So, the ideas of doing it for things, even doing races,

879
00:25:47.431 --> 00:25:49.820
I don't care about my own PR numbers.

880
00:25:49.820 --> 00:25:51.538 line:15%
I wanna have a reason to go fight for.

881
00:25:51.538 --> 00:25:52.788
So, if I'm dining out there,

882
00:25:52.788 --> 00:25:54.106
I'm thinking about why I'm running.

883
00:25:54.106 --> 00:25:57.796
So, I'm sitting home one day and came out of the shower.

884
00:25:57.796 --> 00:26:00.166
And I said, "I think I wanna run across the country.

885
00:26:00.166 --> 00:26:01.569
