945
00:27:42.303 --> 00:27:43.531
like three extra hours.

946
00:27:43.531 --> 00:27:46.285
So, I wanted to make sure I get the same 24 hours as I left.

947
00:27:46.285 --> 00:27:48.931
So, I ran an LA, took a day.

948
00:27:48.931 --> 00:27:50.173
And the next day at midnight,

949
00:27:50.173 --> 00:27:52.130
I got up to run right before I went to the airport.

