958
00:28:13.472 --> 00:28:14.427
I went to run again.

959
00:28:14.427 --> 00:28:16.140
So, it was still in the same time zone.

960
00:28:16.140 --> 00:28:20.386
You maintained the Eastern time zone as the anchor.

961
00:28:20.386 --> 00:28:21.483
And the cool part about that

962
00:28:21.483 --> 00:28:24.872
