1010
00:29:47.097 --> 00:29:48.507
She just started doing research.

1011
00:29:48.507 --> 00:29:49.340
I had no idea.

1012
00:29:49.340 --> 00:29:50.521
She goes, "Hey, Hellah, there's this runner

1013
00:29:50.521 --> 00:29:53.959
who's actually plan-based running across the country.

1014
00:29:53.959 --> 00:29:55.814
He's gonna be literally in our backyard

1015
00:29:55.814 --> 00:29:58.650
to start in New Jersey to go to New York."

1016
00:29:58.650 --> 00:29:59.830
She said we should go meet him.

1017
00:29:59.830 --> 00:30:00.663
I was like, "Yeah, let's do it."

1018
00:30:00.663 --> 00:30:01.986
So, my goal to go mid-ride

1019
00:30:01.986 --> 00:30:03.957
