00:30:05.732 --> 00:30:07.359
"There's no way I can only do five miles.

1022
00:30:07.359 --> 00:30:09.493
I have to do the whole 17 miles with him."

1023
00:30:09.493 --> 00:30:10.894
So, that's how I met Robbie.

1024
00:30:10.894 --> 00:30:11.809
And when I first met him,

1025
00:30:11.809 --> 00:30:13.085
I told Robbie, right then I said,

1026
00:30:13.085 --> 00:30:15.026
"Hey, Robbie, I'm so-and-so.

1027
00:30:15.026 --> 00:30:15.859
I run.

1028
00:30:15.859 --> 00:30:16.982
This is really cool."

1029
00:30:16.982 --> 00:30:19.138
And I said to him, "I'm gonna run across the country."

1030
00:30:19.138 --> 00:30:21.651
